{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_title", "source_sha256": "d0269ae28df236a06af11a8772dc2af304bb31f2c5b645a2321f50c747d3ca36", "ja": "ルーティーン", "zh": "日常惯例", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_synopsis", "source_sha256": "23fb9f92716af5df2d492601676cc863f6e8f7c41e93a58d8ea3bc323dbb33b1", "ja": "記念公演も間近となったある日。レッスンを\n終えた星梨花は、ひとりで劇場へと向かう。\nどこに行くのかと不思議に思ってついてきた\n一同に、星梨花は、本番前に劇場で「いって\nきます」を言いたかった、と語る。", "zh": "纪念公演临近的某一天。结束训练后，星梨花独自前往剧场。对她要去哪里感到疑惑而跟来的众人，听星梨花说，她想在正式演出前，在剧场说一声“我出发了”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ffc621464eb2360f627ee4e35f29629e8e995b3337dd40a6d36d0943781e89cc", "ja": "本番が近づく、ある日のこと……", "zh": "正式演出临近的某一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "439784b08bf6de777a2c9e462e6ba9c1edc242425cd1db7059f43ff8241ba045", "ja": "ふぅ……。みなさん、お疲れさまでした！\nレッスン、いい感じですね。", "zh": "呼……大家辛苦了！\n练习的感觉很好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "7bfc63045fd8be641aaaaed1417b5be28d56d2f1b1a5560770c2cb34fcf8be74", "ja": "星梨花ちゃんも、お疲れさまです！　ムフフ♪\nこれはきっと、歴史に残る公演になりますよぉ……。", "zh": "星梨花也辛苦啦！唔呼呼♪\n这一定会成为载入史册的公演哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "67743925952c33bf79539ee1603fd4dd554b7542b2f0e21220bd74e4bc11a40f", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん。亜利沙さんの提案で、これから\nお茶でもしませんかとのことですが、いかがですか～？", "zh": "星梨花。听说在亜利沙小姐的提议下，接下来要不要一起喝杯茶，您意下如何～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "b61adc5ce2c7774aa0ddabc61f9e817547fb985fd1779351529bcaf525a2b912", "ja": "あっ、わたしは……ごめんなさい、\n今日はちょっと、行きたいところがあって。", "zh": "啊，我……对不起，\n今天有点想去一个地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "ead7975fb6b8b2ce557a45c90ca2a9452ddad25f7b14a33cbfa41fefc0996504", "ja": "お茶、絶対にまた誘ってくださいね！\nすみません。またあした！", "zh": "喝茶的话，请一定要再邀请我哦！\n不好意思，明天见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "5f68d4779cb165cc384e42d5d099c5323e5b300d5f6d09960f377b9a2f08f940", "ja": "星梨花、行っちゃったの。\nなんだか急いでるみたいだったけど、どうしたのかな？", "zh": "星梨花已经走了。\n感觉她好像很着急，不知道是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "5caca81f272c826bfab57beba23f13af9d0f214e8133e28f81d1dbb1eb3874c3", "ja": "星梨花ちゃんが、行きたいところ……？\nうぅ、これはかなり気になりますよぉ！", "zh": "星梨花想去的地方……？\n呜呜，这可真让人在意啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "c6a3674ebf428b77040da2bae8eb469fc33882a31379cbc22cb0c813c74aa664", "ja": "ええと……乗り換え、この駅でいいんだよね？\nいつもと違う路線だから、ドキドキしちゃう……。", "zh": "那个……在这个车站换乘，没错吧？\n因为是平时没坐过的线路，弄得我好紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "8b377d85fc31d164ab966d1a20798622d4fdd37a84a77eb94c85441b16fc82ca", "ja": "来ちゃった！　えへへ。\nよかった、迷わなくて。門限があるから……。", "zh": "到啦！嘿嘿。还好没迷路。因为有门禁时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "a2c42fcad42a3018f89a267969470429421d3860b1d1796a350ba5d8c5afaadd", "ja": "わたしたちの劇場。工事の前までは、ほとんど\n毎日来てたのに……なんだかもうなつかしいな。", "zh": "我们的剧场。施工之前，明明几乎\n每天都来……现在却总觉得已经让人好怀念了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "3f6227ed40632dbbe5c5246c03f4a9916ef22e0fbe9b6f8a8703ede9dbf0c2b7", "ja": "うんうん、不思議な気持ちなの。\nおもしろいね、星梨花！　あはっ☆", "zh": "嗯嗯，感觉真不可思议呢。\n很有意思对吧，星梨花！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "af03c7e8a0e1795c516b757da6741ac7495bbfc7c6ad41b0008c60221f12f79a", "ja": "あれっ、美希さん！？\n亜利沙さんと、朋花さんも……どうしてここに？", "zh": "咦，美希小姐！？\n还有亚利沙小姐和朋花小姐……你们怎么会在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "65edeab31236c34c7975a565f8bf4e55feb0f441f83f18e34eb9827d24ce9d33", "ja": "星梨花ちゃんを追いかけてきたんですよ～。\nどこに行くのか、気になりましたから～。", "zh": "我们是追着星梨花来的哦～  \n因为有点在意她要去哪里嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "f3d50f39c33a2bedca1d599241886c9272a30d96686faae47bad6b30be6c8b99", "ja": "ありさ、アイドルちゃんの追っかけは得意なので……\nあ、いえ、決して変な意味じゃなくて！", "zh": "亚利沙最擅长追踪偶像了……啊，不是，绝对不是奇怪的意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "3cfae3907bb2ee72667be64129a78928ba21d8e942232a1daa4332ae0b5f1b54", "ja": "ええっ、あとをつけてきたんですか！？\n探偵さんみたいに！？", "zh": "诶，你是一路跟踪过来的吗！？\n像侦探一样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "e491b1e03d019753e5034633e0ebb9c28d2cf70ce78a29fdc4ffae6ff6e6bfb1", "ja": "亜利沙が言うと、変な意味にしか聞こえないの。", "zh": "听亚利沙这么一说，怎么听都像是在表达奇怪的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "c14fd4272cf4a39a47cf405eebf89f97f6627958790d9308f1f541d093322bd4", "ja": "それって……もしかして、\nわたしのこと心配してくれたんですか？", "zh": "那个……难道说，您是在担心我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "a6347b6f35b30c3560ead37e3fd172c2d99a7c52d19d115d945e8d18c2ece938", "ja": "そうですね～、同じステージに立つ仲間として。\n星梨花ちゃん、どうしてここへ？", "zh": "是啊～作为同台演出的伙伴。星梨花，你怎么会来这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "8090c07cc4a84f46544d2f5f122f138bd045b24b7071325bc7fd2ae0d0d8380f", "ja": "どうして、ですか……ううん？\n自分でも、言うのが難しいんですけど……。", "zh": "为什么吗……唔？\n这让我自己来说，也有点难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "66fabfd2517382aec900c8c61715a39027fcc1670f3bfbaaf4318d7c58607a8b", "ja": "大切な公演の前は、いつもみたいにここで、\n「いってきます！」って言いたいなって思って。", "zh": "在重要的演出之前，我想像平时那样在这里\n说一声“我出发啦！”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "24dafaad7ff05d978c50419aac1801497fbe3056817f6f6ddeb7826e53350007", "ja": "なるほど……その気持ちは共感できますよ～♪\nここは私たちの、帰る場所ですから。", "zh": "原来如此……我很能理解这种心情哦～♪\n因为这里是我们回来的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "aab1a2f5918dd1aee79c2356657490ee1b30b717837a7c5dba3e17ec7a992a70", "ja": "うんうん！　せっかくだから、みんなで言おうよ！\nほら亜利沙、掛け声ね。", "zh": "嗯嗯！难得有这个机会，大家一起说吧！\n来，亚利沙，你来喊口号。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "13fcc0d7cbdd3f0b97070a11cbd90fd0158911f3519810fc8179b4da4408c8c6", "ja": "ふ、ふおおぉ！　ありさがですか？\nそ、それでは、僭越ながら……ゴホン！　せーのっ！", "zh": "呜、呜哦哦！要我来吗？\n那、那我就恭敬不如从命了……咳咳！预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "fd357f731ed31336291196f8f44ecf9cf07f5dc176363bd57c72417a1a4c6820", "ja": "いってきまーすっ！", "zh": "我出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "fd357f731ed31336291196f8f44ecf9cf07f5dc176363bd57c72417a1a4c6820", "ja": "いってきまーすっ！", "zh": "我出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "6536ec508f297156bd9cf718ee1413f35723477ec5c2d1d591ac738a35634b46", "ja": "行ってきます～。", "zh": "我出门啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0290_story_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_10_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "d9fe384247c920b4f2e2bf56e67661d7475ca56fd3363e43f075b429876202e3", "ja": "行ってきますなの～。", "zh": "我出门啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
